        "title": "fix(dispatch-wrapper): fix flock separator and script command detection",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n1. **flock `--`**: not unwrapped when -- separates lock target from command\n2. **script command**: mislabeled echo as transcript file when -- used\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n- flock: skip past `--` separator\n- script: detect `--` form vs transcript-file form; transcript-only stays blocked\n\n## User Impact\nFixes command execution analysis for flock/script with `--` separator.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-98657-proof.png)\n- `exec-wrapper-resolution.test.ts`: 132/132 ✅ · `exec-approvals-allow-always.test.ts`: 48/48 ✅",
